// tool (Codex and ChatGPT image generation, Figma AI, …) and placed behind or beside the device. This file holds the
// per-niche subject ideas and the prompt recipe; scripts/hero.mjs drives it. The art is style, not a claim: no text,
// no UI, no logos or other brands, no real people (Apple 2.3.3 / 4.1 — the screens still show the real app).

